     ccoonnffiigg..lluuaa — bootloader configuration module

DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
     ccoonnffiigg..lluuaa contains configuration and module loading functionality.

     Before hooking into or using the functionality provided by ccoonnffiigg..lluuaa, it
     must be included with a statement such as the following:

           local config = require("config")

